Pn-l7pReVYa3mLq_Evri-ParcelShop-1-.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,2831,3840&w=960&h=1302","aPn-l7pReVYa3mLq",{"x":21,"y":21,"zoom":22,"background":23},0,1,"transparent",{"dimensions":25,"alt":17,"copyright":9,"url":28,"id":19,"edit":29},{"width":26,"height":27},384,182,"evri-and-asda-launch-parcelshop-service.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaPn-l7pReVYa3mLq_Evri-ParcelShop-1-.png?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1249,2832,1342&w=384&h=182",{"x":21,"y":30,"zoom":22,"background":23},1249,"2025-10-23",[33,83,90,98,104,111],{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":36,"primary":38,"id":81,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":9},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[37],{},{"content":39},[40,45,48,51,54,57,60,63,66,79],{"type":41,"text":42,"spans":43,"direction":44},"paragraph","Evri and Asda has today announced a new partnership that will see the rollout of ParcelShops in all Asda stores — marking a first for a UK supermarket.",[],"ltr",{"type":41,"text":46,"spans":47,"direction":44},"The partnership will allow customers to collect and return parcels from thousands of different retailers, at their local Asda store, offering added convenience ahead of the busy festive period.",[],{"type":41,"text":49,"spans":50,"direction":44},"The service has recently launched in over 300 Asda locations, its Express convenience sites and some of its supermarkets and superstores.",[],{"type":41,"text":52,"spans":53,"direction":44},"It will eventually be rolled out to all 1,200 Asda stores across the UK by April next year.",[],{"type":41,"text":55,"spans":56,"direction":44},"The new service will make it even more convenient for customers to shop with Asda as they can pick up their groceries and collect parcels in one trip, reflecting Asda’s focus on offering a range of services under one roof.",[],{"type":41,"text":58,"spans":59,"direction":44},"With over 97% of urban consumers already within one mile of an Evri pick-up\u002Fdrop-off point, the expansion also highlights the growing popularity of out-of-home (OOH) delivery networks.",[],{"type":41,"text":61,"spans":62,"direction":44},"The announcement follows Evri’s £50 million investment, revealed in June 2025, to double its network of ParcelShops and Lockers to 25,000 locations by 2030.",[],{"type":41,"text":64,"spans":65,"direction":44},"",[],{"type":41,"text":67,"spans":68,"direction":44},"You can find your nearest Evri ParcelShop by visiting: https:\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop.",[69,77],{"start":70,"end":71,"type":72,"data":73},55,93,"hyperlink",{"link_type":74,"url":75,"target":76},"Web","evri-and-asda-launch-parcelshop-service.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop","_blank",{"start":70,"end":71,"type":78},"strong",{"type":41,"text":64,"spans":80,"direction":44},[],"rich_text$3e17074e-984c-431f-af68-ac47b28f726f","rich_text",{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":84,"primary":85,"id":88,"slice_type":89,"slice_label":9},[],{"quoteText":86,"quoteSource":87},"This landmark agreement with fellow Leeds-based Asda strengthens our commitment to creating a delivery network fit for the modern UK shopper, directly giving them choice, convenience and control.\nWe are excited about the opportunities this new partnership will bring, helping to us further drive our ambition to expand our capabilities and deliver an even more comprehensive, cost-effective, and customer-focused service across the UK and beyond.","Martijn de Lange, CEO, Evri Group","quote$0e0b9f45-0dec-4a46-b945-beb927060458","quote",{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":91,"primary":92,"id":97,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":9},[],{"content":93},[94],{"type":41,"text":95,"spans":96,"direction":44},".",[],"rich_text$e60b86cb-5c42-4964-999c-52fc7df18d97",{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":99,"primary":100,"id":103,"slice_type":89,"slice_label":9},[],{"quoteText":101,"quoteSource":102},"One of the things that sets Asda apart is our unmatchable mix of services, so we’re delighted to be partnering with Evri to be able to launch a brand-new one just in time for the festive season.\nWe know how much our customers value convenience, and this service gives them the flexibility to collect or return an Evri parcel whether they’re popping in for a pint of milk in one of our Express stores or doing their big shop in one of our larger stores.","Chris Hall, Vice President, Logistics at Asda","quote$7c429c90-7065-48da-b7d0-ace58858dcf2",{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":105,"primary":106,"id":110,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":9},[],{"content":107},[108],{"type":41,"text":95,"spans":109,"direction":44},[],"rich_text$68e7902d-6351-4e52-bc56-1eaf828c0d19",{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":112,"primary":113,"id":154,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":9},[],{"content":114},[115,120,125,133,137,142,145,148,151],{"type":41,"text":116,"spans":117,"direction":44},"Notes to Editors",[118],{"start":21,"end":119,"type":78},16,{"type":41,"text":121,"spans":122,"direction":44},"Media enquiries  ",[123],{"start":21,"end":124,"type":78},17,{"type":41,"text":126,"spans":127,"direction":44},"For any enquiries relating to Evri Group or its companies; Evri, DHL eCommerce UK, UK Mail and Coll-8, please contact: prteam@evri.com",[128],{"start":129,"end":130,"type":72,"data":131},119,134,{"link_type":74,"url":132,"target":76},"mailto:prteam@evri.com",{"type":41,"text":134,"spans":135,"direction":44}," ",[136],{"start":21,"end":22,"type":78},{"type":41,"text":138,"spans":139,"direction":44},"About Evri  ",[140],{"start":21,"end":141,"type":78},12,{"type":41,"text":143,"spans":144,"direction":44},"Evri Group brings together Evri, DHL eCommerce UK – which in 2026 will be rebranded Evri Premium, a network of DHL - customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8 and business letters leader UK Mail, to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery company. The combined Evri Group will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually",[],{"type":41,"text":146,"spans":147,"direction":44},"Evri, the core operating brand, currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year, and is on a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth.",[],{"type":41,"text":149,"spans":150,"direction":44},"Working with everyone from Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites to gift-givers, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the last five decades and now has a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000 couriers, as well as a growing network of more than 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, and merger with DHL eCommerce UK, Evri Group continues to enhance its international capability and enable world trade.",[],{"type":41,"text":152,"spans":153,"direction":44},"Evri has close to 4 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6\u002F5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience.",[],"rich_text$d943dff3-8312-4cc6-8352-5ee66c413f35","2025-10-23T10:18:01+0000",["Reactive",157],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":158,"$sclients":226,"$sglobal-basket-count":9},{"abtasty":159,"accessibe":163,"appPromoBanner":166,"autoDivertUpdates":170,"awin":173,"bulkInternational":176,"bulkSendEnabled":179,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":182,"enableBasketCount":185,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":188,"euCustomsDuty":191,"groovyAdvert":194,"newInternationalSendFlow":197,"newinternationalpages":204,"oohPreferenceFlag":208,"opentel":211,"premium":214,"savedCards":217,"smallParcelSize":220,"yourPricesDrawer":223},{"_createdAt":160,"_updatedAt":161,"enabled":162},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":164,"_updatedAt":165,"enabled":162},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":167,"_updatedAt":168,"enabled":169},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12: